            "detailed_description": "Have you ever wanted to raise an army of the dead and wipe out pesky humans?<br />\r\nIs the tedious management of the army's infrastructure something you look forward to?<br />\r\nCan you control your army numbers and deal with vampire and zombie numbers swelling without your leave?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n12 undead types to raise.<br />\r\n20 buildings.<br />\r\n4 raw materials.<br />\r\n8 resources.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake a walk on the indie dark side.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is the Tycoon-style Necromancer simulator. <br />\r\nBuild up your base, collect corpses, convert them into minions.<br />\r\nAllocate jobs to your undead host. More jobs open-up as the game progresses.<br />\r\nDefend against human attacks and assault them back.<br />\r\nResearch improvements for the infrastructure.<br />\r\nTake over all human villages to win the game.",
